<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanshi" book-id="b-nanshi-024" chapter-id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling" source-id="s-nanshi-024-ruanwanling-ws1765279">
  <p id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0000" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">阮萬齡</persName>，陳留尉氏人。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0011" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">思曠</persName>，左光祿大夫。父<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0021" ref="03n_n2r_8rt_B">甯</persName>，黃門侍郎。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0028" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">萬齡</persName>少知名，爲<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0035" ref="70y_je5_bm0">孟昶</persName>建威長史。時<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0043" ref="xxh_xtr_3f9">袁豹</persName>、<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0046" ref="f8f_8b2_11c">江夷</persName>相系爲<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0051" ref="70y_je5_bm0">昶</persName>司馬，時人謂<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0058" ref="70y_je5_bm0">昶</persName>府有三素望。<persName id="c-nanshi-024-ruanwanling:p001:m0065" ref="wv8_l6v_kp9">萬齡</persName>家在會稽剡縣，頗有素情，位左戸尚書，太常。出爲湘州刺史，無政績。後爲散騎常侍、金紫光祿大夫，卒。</p>
</text>
